"Commercial Exploitation": any use, direct or indirect, with a view to economic advantage, including
use internal to a company, and including the training or evaluation of artificial intelligence models
for a commercial purpose. Anything that is not Non-Commercial Use is Commercial Exploitation.

"Modified Version": any modification, adaptation, translation or work created from all or part of the
Work.

